  "title": "Thin and Crispy Oatmeal Raisin Cookies",
  "description": "These crispy oatmeal cookies with raisins are thin, buttery, and easy to make from scratch for a heavenly treat that's delicious dunked into coffee.",
  "authors": [
    "Abracadabra"
  ],
